UPDATE companies SET description='New England Motor Racing Supply (NEMRS) was founded in 1992 in Hollis, New Hampshire. The company began as a supplier of Supermodified racing parts and has since become a builder of ISMA Supermodified chassis.

NEMRS supplies a wide range of racing components and builds complete ISMA Supermodified chassis. The operation runs from a facility on Proctor Hill Road, open seven days a week.

The business serves the motorsports industry, specifically Supermodified racing teams and drivers competing in ISMA-sanctioned events.

