job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We employ a variety of decoration techniques and have access to a broad selection of apparel.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='new-england-printwear' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='New England Stainless Steel Fabrication Inc., known as NessFab, has operated from Weymouth, Massachusetts for over 35 years. The company is led by President and CEO Lemoy Titus and Managing Director Nicholas Titus. It began with a straightforward philosophy: do great work and treat people the right way, growing through word of mouth and repeat customers who value quality and reliability.

NessFab provides custom metal fabrication, food service equipment installation, restaurant hood and ventilation system fabrication and installation, field welding, metal refinishing, and equipment retrofitting. The shop works with stainless steel, aluminium, brass, copper, and zinc, serving commercial and industrial projects across Massachusetts, Rhode Island, Connecticut, and New Hampshire. The company also offers standard products engineered for compatibility with common appliances.

Its customer base spans food service, construction, manufacturing, healthcare, and educational institutions, including medical laboratories. Projects range from commercial kitchen installations and ventilation systems for restaurants to sterile components for healthcare labs and institutional facilities for schools.

The company emphasizes quality craftsmanship, reliability, practical problem solving, safety, accountability, collaboration, and continuous improvement. Its ventilation systems carry ISO and NSF certifications to meet health, fire, and safety codes, and field welding is performed efficiently in active environments with minimal disruption.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO certification','NSF certification']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom metal fabrication", "Food service equipment installation", "Restaurant hood and ventilation system fabrication and installation", "Field welding", "Metal refinishing", "Equipment retrofitting"], "industries": ["Food service", "Construction", "Manufacturing", "Healthcare", "Educational", "Medical labs"], "materials": ["Stainless steel", "Aluminium", "Brass", "Copper", "Zinc"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["ISO and NSF certified ventilation systems", "On-site field welding with minimal disruption", "Refinishing and retrofitting as cost-effective alternatives", "Regional coverage across four New England states"], "facts_used": ["Based in Weymouth, Massachusetts -> /about", "Over 35 years in custom metal fabrication -> /about", "Specializes in fabrication of stainless steel, aluminium, brass, copper, zinc -> /about", "Serves food service, construction, manufacturing, healthcare, educational industries -> /about", "Management team: Lemoy Titus (President & CEO), Nicholas Titus (Managing Director) -> /about", "Services: custom metal fabrication, food service equipment installation, restaurant hoods & ventilation, field welding, refinishing, retrofitting -> /services", "ISO and NSF certifications for ventilation systems -> /services", "Operates in Massachusetts, Rhode Island, Connecticut, New Hampshire -> /services", "Works with stainless steel, aluminium, brass, copper, zinc -> /services", "Industries served include healthcare & medical labs -> db"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We specialize in the fabrication of stainless steel, aluminium, brass, copper and zinc.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='new-england-stainless-steel-fabrication-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='New England Table Company operates from a studio in Londonderry, New Hampshire. The business was founded by Ronald Lohse, a former software engineer who turned a woodworking hobby into a full-time practice after years of building digital systems. Lohse’s first shop stood on the shore of a small New Hampshire lake, where the rhythm of hand tools and the scent of walnut rekindled a childhood memory of watching his grandfather, watercolorist Henry Lohse, build paintings layer by layer.

The company produces custom hardwood tables — dining, coffee, console, desk, and conference pieces — along with matching chairs. Each piece is built by hand in the Londonderry studio using live-edge slabs, book-matched pairs, and river-table constructions. The workflow moves from an initial conversation and digital rendering through wood selection, joinery, and hand-applied finish, with clients receiving photographic updates via a private portal. To date, more than 150 tables have been delivered.

Clients include homeowners, interior designers, and trade professionals across New England. A dedicated trade program supports designers specifying pieces for residential and light commercial projects, while the Atelier Experience offers a higher-touch commission tier in which Lohse personally sources the slab and oversees every design decision.

Lohse started the company on the conviction that furniture should be kept for generations, not replaced. That philosophy drives the Zero Waste Collection, which repurposes offcuts into smaller objects, and the practice of personally delivering and installing each table throughout the region so the maker sees the piece settle into its home.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom table design", "Handcrafted joinery", "Hand-applied finishes", "Live edge slab selection", "Book-matched slab assembly", "River table construction", "Custom chair making", "Design rendering and consultation", "Personal delivery and installation", "Client progress portal"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Interior design", "Trade/design professionals", "Office furniture"], "materials": ["Hardwoods", "Walnut", "Live edge slabs"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Handcrafted in a Londonderry, NH studio", "Personal delivery and installation throughout New England", "Atelier commissions with founder-sourced wood", "Live client portal with photographic build updates", "Zero Waste Collection using offcuts"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Londonderry, NH -> db", "Founder Ronald Lohse -> /about", "Custom hardwood tables and chairs made in New Hampshire -> /", "Handcrafted in Londonderry studio -> /", "150+ tables delivered -> /", "Personal delivery throughout New England -> /", "Atelier Experience commissions starting at $15,000 -> /", "Zero Waste Collection -> /", "Trade program for designers -> /", "Client portal with live progress -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Every table is handcrafted in our Londonderry studio, one piece at a time.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='new-england-table-company' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
