UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Ronkonkoma, New York, New York Woodworking operates as a custom woodworking shop specializing in architectural millwork and cabinetry.

The shop produces a range of millwork including custom cabinetry for kitchens, dining rooms, and bathrooms; entertainment centers and built-ins; archways, moldings, coffered ceilings, wainscot paneling, and mantles. It also offers commercial millwork packages.

