The firm’s five divisions—Utility/Renewables, Industrial, Commercial, Stock & Flow, and OEM—each maintain a dedicated director, a focused sales strategy, and local inside and outside sales teams. The company emphasizes a cross-divisional knowledge-sharing model that it says delivers innovative solutions for its partners.

