UPDATE companies SET description='Niltronix Circuits, based in Sugar Land, Texas, was founded in 1982 as a woman-owned small business. The company began with a focus on delivering quality printed circuit solutions with rapid turnarounds for the oil and gas and industrial sectors.

Today, Niltronix operates a 24,000-square-foot facility in West Houston where it fabricates rigid, flex, and rigid-flex printed circuit boards and provides full turnkey assembly services. Its capabilities span PCB fabrication, surface-mount and through-hole assembly, box-build and cable-harness integration, and a suite of in-house testing including burn-in, functional, temperature-cycling, shock, vibration, and environmental screening. Additional value-added services include conformal coating, potting, programming, and staking, with a specialization in high-temperature, high-reliability assemblies. The shop handles everything from quick-turn prototypes to full production runs.

The company serves aerospace, medical, oil and gas, renewable energy, and industrial customers.

Niltronix differentiates itself by acting as an extension of its customers'' operations, emphasizing collaborative partnerships, on-time delivery, and a quality system certified to AS9100 Rev D and ISO 9001:2015.', certifications=ARRAY['AS9100 REV D','ISO 9001:2015','IECEx QAR','IPC-A-610','ANSI/J-STD-001 Class II & III','UL Registered','RoHS Compliance']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB Fabrication (rigid, flex, rigid-flex)", "PCB Assembly (surface mount, through-hole)", "Box Build & Cable Assembly", "Burn-in Testing", "Functional Testing", "Temperature Cycling Testing", "Shock & Vibration Testing", "Environmental Testing", "Conformal Coating", "Potting", "Programming", "Staking", "System Integration"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Medical", "Oil & Gas", "Renewable Energy", "Industrial"], "materials": ["Rigid PCB substrates", "Flex PCB substrates", "Rigid-Flex PCB substrates"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to full production runs", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1982 -> /about", "Headquarters in Sugar Land, Texas -> db", "24,000 sq ft facility in West Houston -> /about", "Woman-Owned Small Business -> /quality", "Certifications: AS9100 Rev D, ISO 9001:2015, IECEx QAR, IPC-A-610, ANSI/J-STD-001 Class II & III, UL Registered, RoHS Compliance -> /quality", "Industries served: Aerospace, Medical, Oil & Gas, Renewable Energy, Industrial -> / and /about", "Capabilities: PCB Fabrication, PCB Assembly, Box Build & Cable Assembly, Testing (burn-in, functional, temperature cycling, shock/vibration, environmental), Conformal Coating, Potting, Programming, Staking -> / and /about", "Focus on high-temperature, high-reliability assemblies -> /about", "Quick-turn prototyping to full production -> /about and /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "manufacturing printed circuit boards (Fabs), printed circuit boards, cable and box build assemblies", "founded_ye