UPDATE companies SET description='Nola Solar Energy is a New Orleans, Louisiana-based solar installation and service company founded by a team with over seven years of hands-on industry experience. The locally owned and operated business was built around a practical approach to solar, battery backup, EV charging, and long-term system support.

The company provides turnkey solar systems for homes and small businesses, including design, permitting, and code-compliant installation. It also installs battery backup systems tailored to essential loads, Level 2 EV chargers with panel assessment and wiring, and offers a full suite of service work: inspection, troubleshooting, repair, cleaning, panel removal and reinstall, inverter and monitoring support, and system upgrades.

Nola Solar Energy serves residential homeowners and small commercial customers across Louisiana and the Gulf South. Its projects range from new rooftop solar arrays and battery storage for outage protection to EV charger installations and service calls for existing systems originally installed by other providers. The company also supports off-grid power projects and commercial parking-lot solar structures.

The firm emphasizes its licensed and insured electrical team, brand-certified installer status for major solar, battery, and inverter equipment, and a sales-plus-service model that handles both new installations and ongoing maintenance. Customers frequently cite quick response times, clear communication, and a structured service process as key differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar Installation", "Battery Backup Systems", "Level 2 EV Charger Installation", "Solar Service & Repair", "Solar Panel Cleaning", "Panel Removal & Reinstall", "System Inspection", "System Upgrade", "Off-grid Power Support"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Off-grid Power"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Licensed electrical contractor with full insurance", "Brand-certified installers for major solar, battery, and inverter brands", "Sales and service under one roof including repairs and panel removal/reinstall", "Quick response to service requests and project concerns", "5-star Google reviews highlighting communication and problem-solving"], "facts_used": ["Location: New Orleans, Louisiana -> /", "Locally Owned & Operated -> /", "Over 7 years of hands-on experience -> /about", "Services: Solar Installation, Battery Backup, EV Charger Installation, Solar Service & Repair -> /", "Service details: inspection, troubleshooting, repair, cleaning, panel removal/reinstall, inverter support, monitoring support, battery service -> /services", "Serves homeowners and small businesses across Louisiana and Gulf South -> /", "Commercial work and off-grid power support mentioned -> /", "Licensed Electrical Contractor, Fully Insured -> /", "Brand-Certified Installers for leading solar, battery, inverter, monitoring brands -> /", "5-Star Google Reviews -> /", "Quick Response, Time Availability, New Orleans Based -> /", "Sales + Service Under One Roof -> /about", "Structured service proces