UPDATE companies SET description='Noreast Custom Apparel operates from Lowell, Massachusetts. It presents itself as a custom apparel decorator focused on helping clients create a lasting impression through branded merchandise.

The shop provides screen printing, heat pressing, finishing, and merch store fulfillment in-house, while embroidery is fulfilled through a local contract partner. Screen printing runs 12–14 business days with a minimum order requirement; embroidery runs 8–10 business days. The facility handles team packages including hats, bags, track suits, uniforms, and jerseys, and offers design services with digital artwork approval before production. Ink options include plastisol, water-based, vinyl, discharge, and plasticharge.

Customers include community organizers, sports leagues, corporate teams, and group events such as walks and flag football. The company also markets contract printing services to other businesses needing decoration capacity.

