UPDATE companies SET description='O&G Studio operates from a factory in Warren, Rhode Island. The company was founded in 2009 by Jonathan Glatt and Sara Ossana. Glatt, who serves as creative director and CEO, brought a background in jewelry and antiques to the venture, shaping a design language that blends historical and natural reference with sculptural clarity.

The studio produces a full range of seating, tables, lighting, decorative accents, and cabinet hardware. Its hardware collections — including Cygnet, Atlantic, and Cleat — are crafted in solid brass with a variety of finishes.

O&G serves interior designers, architects, and collectors worldwide through trade accounts and direct specification. The firm''s work has been specified in projects featured by The New York Times, The Wall Street Journal, Architectural Digest, Elle Decor, Wallpaper, Dwell, and other design publications. Vogue named Glatt one of ten contemporary designers to collect today.

